/-- In [a finite dimension](hyp:d), [the closed coordinate support](goal) is
[the set where every coordinate has absolute value at most one](step:1). -/
def coordinateSupport (d : ℕ) : Set (Fin d → ℝ) :=
  {x | ∀ i, |x i| ≤ 1}

